  )]
  , kind: table
  )

#horizontalrule

== Part 6 --- Resident vs.~Traveller Imams
<part-6-resident-vs-traveller-imams>
#figure(
  align(center)[#table(
    columns: 2,
    align: (auto,auto,),
    table.header([Imam], [Ẓuhr & ʿAṣr],),
    table.hline(),
    [#strong[Resident (of Makkah)]], [Prays the #strong[full four
    rakʿahs] each],
    [#strong[Traveller (Musāfir)]], [Prays #strong[two rakʿahs (Qaṣr)]
    each],
  )]
  , kind: table
  )

#strong[The traveller imam,] after finishing, instructs the residents
behind him:

#quote(block: true)[
#strong[«أَتِمُّوا صَلَاتَكُمْ يَا أَهْلَ مَكَّةَ فَإِنَّا قَوْمٌ سَفْرٌ»]

#emph["Complete your prayer, O people of Makkah, for we are a travelling
people."]

#emph[\(Based on the Prophet's ﷺ general practice when leading residents
as a traveller --- as cited in class.)]
]

- #strong[Followers who are travellers] pray #strong[two rakʿahs] behind
  him.
- #strong[Followers who are residents] must #strong[stand and complete
  the remaining two rakʿahs] on their own after the imam concludes.

#horizontalrule

== Closing
<closing>
