  except Wādī ʿUranah) and the #strong[Ghusl] of ʿArafah (mustaḥabb);
  the two #strong[khuṭbahs] (Sunnah, for teaching the manāsik; adhān
  from the minbar); #strong[combining Ẓuhr & ʿAṣr] (Jamʿ Taqdīm --- one
  adhān, two iqāmahs, no nawāfil between, silent recitation); the
  #strong[Ḥanafī conditions] (order; a valid Ẓuhr first) and the
  #strong[congregation requirement] (combining only with an
  imam/jamāʿah; the individual prays each at its own time); and
  #strong[resident vs.~traveller imam] rulings (full vs.~qaṣr, and the
  "complete your prayer" instruction).
